sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(232,245,233) Host service
    participant A as Auditor or host code
  end
  box rgb(224,242,241) Rule Engine, in process
    participant E as RuleEngine
    participant C as Compiled cache
  end
  box rgb(255,248,225) Host PostgreSQL
    participant DB as rle_decision, rle_version
  end
  rect rgb(255,248,225)
    Note over A,DB: Read-only transaction, writes nothing
    A->>E: replay(decisionId), tenant from resolver, needs rules:log:read
    alt not a ULID
      E-->>A: 404 DECISION_NOT_FOUND, no query
    end
    E->>DB: SELECT rle_decision by tenant, id, created_at in the ULID's millisecond
    alt not found in that millisecond
      E->>DB: SELECT by tenant, id, created_at up to that millisecond (clock went back)
    end
    alt no row in this tenant
      E-->>A: 404 DECISION_NOT_FOUND
    end
    E->>DB: SELECT rle_version by rule set and logged version number, never selecting
    E->>C: compiled version, hash checked (ADR-0026)
    alt a masked input had a value
      E-->>A: 422 REPLAY_NOT_POSSIBLE, names the inputs, never the values
    end
    E->>E: evaluate logged inputs at the logged clock, today() in the version's timeZone
    E-->>A: DecisionResult with the logged decisionId and clock
  end
